{"path":"utility/stacktrace_entry/operator_ltlt","title":"std::operator<<(std::stacktrace_entry)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>operator&lt;&lt;<small>(std::stacktrace_entry)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/stacktrace_entry/operator_ltlt","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts the description of f into the output stream os. Equivalent to return os << std::to_string(f);.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/stacktrace\">&lt;stacktrace&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1746\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1746\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/stacktrace_entry\"><span class=\"kw3633\">std::<span class=\"me2\">stacktrace_entry</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> f <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts the description of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f</span></code> into the output stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/to_string\"><span class=\"kw1273\">std::<span class=\"me2\">to_string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> os\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> an output stream\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> f\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>stacktrace_entry</code> whose description is to be inserted\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stacktrace&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> f <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">stacktrace</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> f <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0x0000000000402AA7 in ./prog.exe\n__libc_start_main in /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6\n0x00000000004029B9 in ./prog.exe</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/basic_stacktrace/operator_ltlt\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  performs stream output of <code>basic_stracktrace</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/stacktrace_entry","title":"std::stacktrace_entry"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::operator<<(std::stacktrace_entry)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Inserts the description of f into the output stream os. Equivalent to return os << std::to_string(f);."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"os, f"},{"label":"Return value","note":"os"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator<<","note":"performs stream output of basic_stracktrace"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":95,"codeBlockCount":2}
